Subject: [PATCH 28/44] docs: the image path in the recipe

Names the tower's shape, that it is the same one TensorFold already reads at this
model's width, and the one non-obvious mapping: qwen_vl finds it through the
mlx-vlm vision_tower.* prefix in bf16, so the converter rewrites and leaves those
333 tensors unquantized. Video stays out of scope.
