 docs/recipes/sensenova-loop-9b-metal.md | 21 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docs/recipes/sensenova-loop-9b-metal.md b/docs/recipes/sensenova-loop-9b-metal.md
index 72bbd67af..ee23ac094 100644
--- a/docs/recipes/sensenova-loop-9b-metal.md
+++ b/docs/recipes/sensenova-loop-9b-metal.md
@@ -55,6 +55,25 @@ Each visit owns its KV and recurrent state, 14 attention and 42 linear slots.
 `--no-drafts` is the only supported mode: this checkpoint ships no drafter, and the loop's second visit is not a
 speculative path. Do not enable MTP or DFlash2 against it.
 
+## Images
+
+The checkpoint carries a 27-block Qwen3.5-VL tower: hidden 1152, 16 heads of 72, intermediate 4304, a 5-D conv3d
+patch embed `[1152, 3, 2, 16, 16]`, and a merger to 4096. It is the same tower TensorFold reads for Qwen3.8-27B, at
+this model's 4096 width instead of 5120, so the engine's existing `core/qwen_vl` reader takes it unchanged.
+
+The conversion carries it, and one detail is not obvious: `core/qwen_vl` finds the tower through the mlx-vlm prefix
+`vision_tower.*` and reads bf16 only, so the converter rewrites `model.visual.<name>` to `vision_tower.<name>` and
+leaves those 333 tensors unquantized while the language model stays affine 4-bit. The tower costs 0.85 GiB, taking
+the checkpoint to 5.57 GiB, and `--vision` loads it with 1.78 GiB of scratch for 4096 image tokens a request.
+
+```bash
+zig-out/native/bin/tensorfold-native serve loop9b-vision-mlx4 --name loop9b \
+  --context 4096 --prompt-cache-gib 0 --no-drafts --vision
+```
+
+JPEG input needs libjpeg-turbo 3.1.4.1 (`TENSORFOLD_LIBTURBOJPEG`); PNG needs nothing. Image rows enter at the
+embedding, and the loop and mHC then run over the whole sequence, image rows included, as they do for text.
+
 ## Measured on an M5 Ultra (macOS 27.2), 4-bit, drafts off
 
 Cold prefill, one fresh process or server per arm, chunk 2048 (the M5 default), 2 repetitions that agree to 0.3%.
@@ -131,7 +150,7 @@ recipe measures against.
 
 ## What is not covered
 
-- images and video: the 27-block vision tower is not converted or loaded, and image parts are refused.
+- video: the processor's video path is not wired, and video parts are refused.
 - contexts past 262144: the checkpoint advertises 524288 positions, but admission caps at 262144.
 - concurrent streams: every number here is one stream.
 - other Apple chips: measured on M5 Ultra only.
